        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">mixing curves are the graphical representations which describe phase behaviour of polymer systems which are essential for predicting the phase morphology of polymer systems influencing the physical, mechanical and chemical properties of polymers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
